library (polari_cnt) {
  /* generated by cntfet.cnt_cell_library_basis — executor polari-own-loop.
     UNITS: time ps, capacitance fF, internal_power aJ (uW x ps).
     internal_power = supply energy per output transition from the SAME
     transient, leakage baseline subtracted, output-load CV^2 removed on
     the rising edge (Liberty-internal). Pass-gate arcs (MUX2 A/B) source
     their output charge from the input driver, so their supply energy is
     honestly ~0 (clamped at 0, flagged in the run report).
     INTRINSIC-grade (S1 model, labeled standin parasitics, 50/50 charge
     partition). NOT signoff (plan D1). */
